  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组新增3个JEI分类：\"信标基座方块\"显示可用作信标基座的方块，\"信标支付物品\"展示信标接受哪些物品作为祭品，\"海灵核心框架方块\"则列出能激活海灵核心的框架方块。</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">鸣谢：本模组最初由<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/tfarecnim/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">tfarecnim</a>开发，但如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-beacons/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a>所示，他在1.16.5版本后停止了更新。因此我决定将其移植到最新版Minecraft。</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nyVakCY.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"634\"></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cerbons-better-beacons-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cerbon's Better Beacons模组</a>兼容。当悬停在物品/方块上时，您可以看到每个祭品增加的作用范围数值，以及每个基座方块提升的主效果增幅强度。</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/J1P8cJV.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"634\"></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您可能还会对我的其他项目感兴趣：</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/queen-bee\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂后[FORGE版]</a></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cerbons-better-beacons-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">CERBON强化信标[FORGE版]</a></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-totem-of-undying-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">CERBON强化不死图腾[FORGE版]</a></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-totem-of-undying-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">CERBON强化不死图腾[FABRIC版]</a></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">请将所有漏洞、问题和功能请求提交至<a href=\"https://github.com/CerbonXD/Just-Enough-Beacons/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a>，或加入我的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2PvYZfjWDf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器</a>在对应频道反馈。评论区仅用于模组相关讨论。</span></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fCerbon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CERBONs_Better_Totem_of_Undying/BH_CBTU_promo.webp&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"250\"></a><br><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/QceKzaB.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"></p>",
